
                ISO 2768-1:1989 General Tolerances

                This International Standard specifies general tolerances for linear and angular dimensions
                without individual tolerance indications in technical drawings.

                Tolerance Classes:
                - f: fine
                - m: medium
                - c: coarse
                - v: very coarse

                Linear Dimensions:
                - Up to 6mm: ±0.1mm (f), ±0.2mm (m), ±0.5mm (c)
                - 6-30mm: ±0.2mm (f), ±0.5mm (m), ±1.0mm (c)
                - 30-120mm: ±0.3mm (f), ±0.8mm (m), ±1.5mm (c)
                